  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Public Administration Reform i Serbien  fas 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Public Administration Reform in Serbia phase 2 - PAR MPALSG phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det g&#xe4;ller st&#xe4;rkande av kapaciteten hos ministeriet f&#xf6;r F&#xf6;rvaltning, samt genomf&#xf6;rande av f&#xf6;rvaltningsreformplanen samt den   handlingsplan som antagits av serbiska regeringen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this contribution is to support implementation of Government&apos;s PAR Strategy and PAR AP.The programme  will build the capacity within MPALSG to coordinate, manage and       implement the PAR AP as well as manage and implement EU funds.The     programme is intended to contribute to &quot;paving the way&quot; for the       absorption of EU funding in the area of PAR and EU Integration.</narrative>
  </description>
